# Swedish (`sv-se`) data pipeline

- After changing **TSV** files (`references/*list*.tsv`), **corpus fixtures**, or **scripts** under `locales/sv-se/`, run:

  `npm run sv:pipeline`

- The pipeline verifies outputs (prescriptive counts, 50+50 corpus, 200 prompts, JSON shapes, calibration fields) and writes **`locales/sv-se/references/PIPELINE-SNAPSHOT.md`**. Treat that file as the ground truth for what was last regenerated.

- If a run fails, fix the error and continue with:

  `npm run sv:pipeline -- --resume`

- Optional: `--with-extended` (Wikipedia + extended-aware freq/validate by default), `--freq-include-extended` (same freq/validate if extended/ already exists), `--no-freq-include-extended` with `--with-extended` for log-odds-only extended. See `locales/sv-se/docs/SWEDISH-EXTENSION.md`.
